# Analysis & Recommendation

Based on your request for a **spreadsheet-like table editor** in Vue3, I recommend using **[Handsontable](https://handsontable.com/)** or **[ag-Grid Community](https://www.ag-grid.com/)**. However, for a lighter solution integrated with your markdown rendering, I'll create a custom solution using **[vue-grid-layout](https://jbaysolutions.github.io/vue-grid-layout/)** + custom table editing.

Here's my implementation plan:

## Solution: Custom Interactive Table Editor Component

I'll create a reusable `InteractiveTable.vue` component that:
- ✅ Allows cell selection (click to select, drag to multi-select)
- ✅ Inline editing with keyboard support
- ✅ Row/column operations (add, delete, move)
- ✅ Copy/paste functionality
- ✅ Data persistence via events
- ✅ Spreadsheet-like UI

