## Key Features

✅ **Seamless Integration**: Tables are extracted and rendered separately while preserving markdown content  
✅ **Mixed Content**: Markdown text, code blocks, and tables all coexist  
✅ **Spreadsheet UI**: Full row/column selection, editing, add/delete operations  
✅ **TailwindCSS**: No custom CSS, all styling via Tailwind classes  
✅ **Vue3 Structure**: Follows your component pattern exactly  
✅ **Event Emission**: `table-updated` event sent to parent  
✅ **Responsive**: Horizontal scroll for large tables  

